          "worked": "Use the last digit as the leaf and the preceding digit or digits as the stem. Put the leaves in ascending order, retaining repeats.\n\n$$\\begin{array}{r|l}\\text{Stem}&\\text{Leaves}\\\\\\hline7&4\\;6\\;6\\;6\\\\8&0\\;1\\;1\\;2\\;2\\;2\\;4\\;4\\;5\\;6\\;8\\\\9&1\\;2\\;2\\;6\\;6\\;9\\\\10&1\\\\\\end{array}$$\n\nKey: $8\\mid5=85\\text{ cm}$.\n\nThe rows contain $4+11+6+1=22$ leaves, matching the 22 measurements.",
